<h2>8. PO, PSO &amp; SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT GOALS (SDG) ALIGNMENT</h2>

<h3>8.1 Problem Statement &amp; Main Objectives</h3>
<p>
<strong>Problem Statement:</strong> In conventional healthcare polyclinics and municipal dispensaries, appointment bookings are managed via manual registers or chaotic walk-in crowds. This results in doctor double-booking, prolonged patient wait times, nosocomial infection risks, lack of digital auditability, and poor resource utilization.
</p>
<p>
<strong>Main Objectives:</strong> Design and construct an enterprise full-stack web application that allows patients to register and reserve doctor appointments online, enforces strict database-level concurrency protection against duplicate slot bookings, provides receptionists with an operational command center to filter and confirm schedules, and issues digital medical tokens.
</p>

